{"title":"Snow Fox","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 2 Wildlife that attacks with stab (melee). It will not attack first.</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-650.5px,399.6px)\"><i style=\"left:627.0px;top:-414.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:660.1px;top:-387.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:625.7px;top:-370.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:760.3px;top:-447.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:683.4px;top:-431.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:656.5px;top:-394.7px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around -109, -1055 <span class=\"muted\">· 5 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 422, -1067 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li><li>in the wilds around 525, -804 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li><li>in the wilds around 468, -867 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li><li>in the wilds around -98, -1204 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li><li>in the wilds around 524, -798 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li><li>in the wilds around 320, -1144 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"snow-fox\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Wildlife: <a href=\"#/monster/seagull\">Seagull</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/rabbit\">Rabbit</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/chicken\">Chicken</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span> · <a